1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,300
Many patients possess social support
but lack medical recognition.

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:08,100
I possessed increasing medical recognition
while losing social support.

3
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:11,500
At first this appeared to be a contradiction.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,300
Later I realized it was a paradox.

5
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:17,600
Both realities were true.

6
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,400
Both patients were suffering.

7
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:24,930
Both patients were searching for
the same thing: stability.

8
00:00:24,930 --> 00:00:29,400
Reality still has to be held by people —

9
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:32,000
a family, a physician, a reviewer.

10
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,930
What Neverlost adds is a way to carry
that reality faithfully between them.
